The Sonic Lab 20.4 loudspeaker layout in `src/audio/immersive/sonic-lab.js`
describes a real installation at the Anton Bruckner Privatuniversität, Linz.
It is included as technical data. There is no claim of affiliation with, or
endorsement by, the university.

This software is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or certified by Dolby
Laboratories, Sony, Fraunhofer IIS, the ITU, or the EBU. References to their
standards describe what this software attempts to implement, and the accuracy
of those attempts is documented in `docs/LIMITATIONS.md`.
